   {
    "quote": "Borderlands 4 delivers fast-paced action, next-gen visuals, and excellent PC performance with impressive use of DLSS 4. Its engaging story, charismatic characters, and a diverse set of activities will keep fans hooked but replaying can feel less exciting over time. Post-launch content promises to keep the chaos alive on planet Kairos.",
